+# JBGS logging (PHD-MAIN-BASELINES-v1, order 5.5 3): per training view the alignment's scale, shift, loss, SfM points used and
+# depth weight 0.6 exp(-150 loss); written to <scene>/jbgs_alignment.json by readColmapSceneInfo. JBGS_KEEP_ALIGN_ARRAYS=1 also
